WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.260
Inside an engine, a gas goes
round the same cycle of changes,

2
00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:06.100
over and over.

3
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:09.290
On every lap it takes
in energy by heating.

4
00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:13.300
And at the end of every lap it
is back exactly where it started:

5
00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:16.860
same pressure, same
volume, same temperature.

6
00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:20.230
So where did all the energy it took in go?

7
00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:25.200
In this mission, you'll split a path on a
pressure–volume graph into simple steps,

8
00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.370
and track the energy in each.

9
00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:32.090
Then you'll take a gas all the way round
a loop and balance the energy books.

10
00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.440
Your mission: find out where the
energy the gas took in has gone.
